*.log
# gem5-512/ bulk stays out (per-test raw logs, m5out .d dirs, .done markers,
# list.effective) — but the two SMALL structured provenance-record files are
# IN (PR #307 #30): batch.tsv (one row per executed test, feeds the verdicts
# extraction + provenance audit) and identity.txt (batch-time binary
# identity, written by gem5-512-batch.sh since 2026-10-30; the 2026-10-29
# legacy batch predates it — see gem5-512-verdicts.txt's identity-source
# header line for that batch's honest fallback).
/gem5-512/*
!/gem5-512/batch.tsv
!/gem5-512/identity.txt
